        {
            "title": "Anthropic上市未能提振AI交易熱情，華爾街期貨下跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Xanadu股價因GlobalFoundries量子製造合作協議大漲17%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9b05ef34afc548fe6945b8f3359af7dbf4eb3234713b0f920a369ac010cc84ea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEM3K18K_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Xanadu股價因GlobalFoundries量子製造合作協議大漲17%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com — 美國股指期貨於週四晚間下滑，投資者在華爾街遭遇大幅拋售後持續保持謹慎態度。人工智能公司Anthropic創紀錄的公開上市未能重燃市場對該板塊的熱情。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">標普500指數期貨下跌0.3%，報7,173.75點；納斯達克100指數期貨下跌0.7%，報26,421.75點，上述數據截至美國東部時間下午7:55(北京時間次日上午7:55)。道指期貨下跌0.2%，報49,080.0點。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-30d274ec-7fd7-3986-984a-de149fe01fd2-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Anthropic (NASDAQ:ANT) 股價在盤後交易中下跌近4%。該股首個交易日收漲17.1%，但遠低於早盤一度令公司估值短暫突破2萬億美元的漲幅。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Anthropic股票開盤報111.50美元，高於83美元的首次公開發行價，但隨後回吐大部分早盤漲幅，最終收於97.17美元。此次上市共募資813億美元，創下史上最大規模IPO紀錄。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">三大主要股指在週四的常規交易時段均下跌逾2%。道瓊斯工業平均指數下跌2.2%，標普500指數下跌2%，連續第六個交易日錄得跌幅。納斯達克綜合指數下跌2.3%，收盤至2025年4月14日以來的最低水平。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次拋售反映出市場對科技股估值過高、人工智能相關支出可持續性，以及數據中心基礎設施龐大投資回報率的持續擔憂。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">儘管英偉達 (NASDAQ:NVDA) 發布了樂觀的營收預測，芯片股仍承壓。英偉達股價下跌3.3%，連跌六個交易日；超微半導體 (AMD) 則在做淡機構Hunterbrook披露對其持有空倉後暴跌7.7%。雲端基礎設施供應商CoreWeave和Nebius分別下跌6.1%和9.4%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Anthropic的上市最初為受挫的AI交易帶來一線希望，這家Claude聊天機器人開發商的股票開盤較IPO定價高出34%，一度令公司估值達到約2萬億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">然而，股價從盤中高位回落，未能引發更廣泛的買盤興趣，凸顯出投資者對增加該板塊持倉的猶豫態度。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">其他方面，派拓網絡 (Palo Alto Networks, NASDAQ:PANW) 在上調2027年營收展望後上漲6.4%；沃爾瑪 (Walmart, NASDAQ:WMT) 則因發布令人失望的年度銷售預測而下滑1%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">投資者同時持續關注聯準會的政策走向。聯準會10月會議紀要進一步強化了市場對貨幣政策繼續收緊的預期。根據CME FedWatch數據，市場目前預計聯準會在12月會議上加息25個基點的概率高達96%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">投資者將密切關注下週公布的個人消費支出通脹報告，以尋找聯準會政策走向的進一步線索。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/anthropic%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E6%8C%AFai%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%86%B1%E6%83%85-%E8%8F%AF%E7%88%BE%E8%A1%97%E6%9C%9F%E8%B2%A8%E4%B8%8B%E8%B7%8C-021153690.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 10:23:51",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜道指失守五萬關 亞太股市周五全線重挫",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜道指失守五萬關 亞太股市周五全線重挫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜道指失守五萬關 亞太股市周五全線重挫</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美股周四（19日）再度急挫，道瓊斯指數瀉1,101點或2.2%，收報49,097點，失守50,000點關口。利淡情緒迅速傳導至亞太區，周五（20日）早上韓國KOSPI指數報4,907點，跌4.5%。台灣加權指數報37,015點，跌3.67%。日經指數報57,050點，跌4%。晶片股成跌市重災區，SK海力士瀉7.4%，三星電子跌5.9%，台積電跌2.4%，軟銀急挫14.6%。</p></div>",
